Operator: Asset management platform
State of the Union
Operator
Purpose-built software platform tracks assets at the fleet, site,
and individual unit levels. Aggregates large data sets that enable
the development of scaled automations. At mining sites, monitors
temperature, fan speeds, hashrate performance, and miner errors.
Identifies and diagnoses miner dysfunctions to streamline miner
repair operations.
 &#x25B8; Scalable at core
 &#x25B8; Multi-facility by design
